SUMMARY:Abbamania at Casa Loma with Dinner (Dupont Station)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Wednesday\, June 17th\, join Casa Lom
 a's Tribute Show: Abbamania.** This will be an electrifying tribute filled
  with timeless favourites—Fernando\, Mamma Mia\, Dancing Queen\, and mor
 e—performed with energy\, elegance\, and just the right touch of nostalg
 ia. Abbamania is the longest running ABBA Tribute Concert in the World\, r
 unning since 1999.\nThe group aims for to you experience how a LIVE concer
 t would have felt all those years ago\, bringing you the best in vocals\, 
 musicianship and musical arrangements. This year\, I feel like the concert
 s have been elevated with high performing groups\, and this will be the fi
 rst of three concerts we will see at Casa Loma this summer\, each with dif
 ferent genres of music. **Purchase Tribute Show: Abbamania on Wednesday Ju
 ne 17th at 7:30pm.**\n\n**COST**\nRegular Cost: $55 + service fees\n\nMeet
 up Organizer Fee: $5\n\n**Ticket Policy**: All sales are final\, you may b
 e able to exchange for another date.\n\n**Prior to RSVPing\, here is what 
 you need to know about attending dinner:**\n\\- Dining in the garden is fi
 rst come\\\, and the recommendation is to arrive when doors open at 5pm\\\
 , which is our plan\\. Casa Loma does not allow reservations in the garden
 \\.\n\\- A minimum $20 spend per person is required in the garden\n\\- Hal
 f your party has to show up in order to be seated in the garden\; if not y
 ou will be seated based on current people at that time\n\\- Dining tables 
 may also be in the glass pavilion\\\, if not it will be set up theatre sty
 le\n\\- Al fresco drinks and food will be available onsite\\\, and you wil
 l need to eat in your lap if you don't make it into the garden\n\\- This c
 oncert proceeds shine or rain\\. It it rains\\\, they try to cover the are
 a over the tables\n\\- If we dine in the garden\\\, we will move into the 
 pavilion 30 mins prior to concert start\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP Yes 
 confirming if you will join for dinner prior. Note: everyone goes on the w
 aitlist until they post they have their ticket**\n* **[Purchase](https://w
 ww.ticketweb.ca/event/tribute-show-abbamania-casa-loma-tickets/14791433)**
  **your own ticket and select the June 17th date**\, post your seat number
  and I will move you to going.\n\nA reminder will be sent the day before w
 ith my cell and reminder details where to meet and when.\n\nRSVPs close 2 
 days prior and the Waitlist will be removed at that time. Cancellations wi
 ll result in a No Show and impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n*
 *Meet me for Dinner: at 5pm (just outside the east entrance leading to the
  pavilion inside Casa Loma at 1 Austin Terrace)**\n\n**Meet me for the Sho
 w at: 7pm inside the pavilion (we aren't allowed to save seats and hope we
  can all sit together)**\n\n**Start: 7:30pm**\n\nLength: estimate 2 hours\
 n\nAfter: we will head over to take some pics of the special lighting of t
 he exterior of the castle and potential waterfall\n\nEnjoy and please post
  your comments in the Event after.
