SUMMARY:Virtual REGISTER: Alfred Hitchcock's The 39 Steps (Toronto)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: When you RSVP Yes\, you will also 
 need to click on the Register link in the Signing Up section to obtain you
 r personal link to the show.**\n\n**On Saturday June 20th\, see Alfred Hit
 chcock's The 39 Steps.** *The 39 Steps* is fast\, witty\, and full of susp
 ense. Released in 1935\, this classic thriller follows Canadian Richard Ha
 nnay (Robert Donat)\, an ordinary man who becomes caught up in a dangerous
  web of spies\, secrets\, and mistaken identity after a chance encounter p
 ulls him into an international conspiracy! With its mix of intrigue\, humo
 ur\, romance\, and Hitchcock’s unmistakable flair for tension\, *The 39 
 Steps* helped define the “wrong man” thriller and remains one of the d
 irector’s most entertaining early films. Over 90 years later\, it still 
 moves with terrific energy and reminds us why Hitchcock became known as th
 e master of suspense. **Register for Alfred Hitchcock's The 39 Steps on Sa
 turday June 20th.**\n\n**COST**\nPay What You Can\, or Free\, if you're un
 able to donate\n\n**SIGNING UP**\n\n* Simply RSVP Yes and **[Register](htt
 ps://www.eventbrite.ca/e/tfs-presents-alfred-hitchcocks-the-39-steps-1935-
 tickets-1990232790853?aff=oddtdtcreator&mc_cid=f780cf2767&mc_eid=0319b5c8d
 0)**[ ](https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/friday-september-26th-tfs-presents-alf
 red-hitchcocks-the-lodger-1927-tickets-1489689564589)here to receive your 
 link to the event.\n* You will be sent an invite with the link\, that you 
 can add to your calendar\n* **Pre-show starts: 7:15pm**\n* **Show starts: 
 7:30pm by clicking on the personal link sent to you by the company**\n* Le
 ngth: 2 hours\n* RSVPs close 1 day prior to start time\n*\n\nEnjoy and ple
 ase post your Comments after!
