 ncert proceeds shine or rain\\. It it rains\\\, they try to cover the area
  over the tables\n\\- If we dine in the garden\\\, we will move into the p
 avilion 30 mins prior to concert start\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP Yes c
