SUMMARY:Guided Walking Tour of Yorkville 
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Wednesday\, July 22nd**\, **join a Gu
 ided Walking Tour of Yorkville.** Evolving from an 1800’s tollgate villa
 ge at the edge of Toronto to an upscale commercial destination\, see how t
 his iconic neighbourhood has maintained its character despite being engulf
 ed by the city. These Tours are guided by docents\, and run rain or shine.
  However\, if the forecast calls for rain\, I will make a call 3 hours pri
